      "updated": 1790006400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Toolkit packages the existing bot and Teams app.\nNo extra bot identity is created by Toolkit.\nRemote state is not conversation storage.\nA private blob container is not a Private Endpoint.",
